{"ac":1,"ac_digest":"c3a89d779c37","ac_text":"[REVIEW] Verify the warning is informative without being noisy","criterion_class":"taste","delegation_class":"REVIEWER-JUDGES","dispatch_id":"judge-t-1426-r5-claude-code-5aa4a05d20b8","evidence":[".context/reviews/evidence/T-1426/AC1-judge-t-1426-r5-claude-code-5aa4a05d20b8.md"],"evidence_sha256":{".context/reviews/evidence/T-1426/AC1-judge-t-1426-r5-claude-code-5aa4a05d20b8.md":"6af68cae0abfe03e2dbc5f24456eb7896a19fc8ed0504f6d5dd869827536f8f7"},"guidance":"All 7 legacy verbs warn exactly once and TERMLINK_NO_DEPRECATION_WARN=1 suppresses (checked on paths that reach the helper). Two replacement hints are wrong: (1) file send says 'termlink channel post --file' but channel post has no --file flag (and the T-1166 migration guide says to keep using file send/receive); (2) targeted event broadcast says 'event emit_to' but the verb is 'emit-to'. Fix file.rs:185 and events.rs:280. Also fix the AC steps: 'remote push x --message x' and 'event broadcast topic-x payload' fail clap parsing before the helper runs, so the step-4 suppression check prints 0 for that reason, not because of suppression. Use 'remote push 127.0.0.1:1 x --message x --secret <64hex>' and 'event broadcast topic-x --payload notjson'.","id":"V-20261026-753303a7","judgement":{"contract":"judge_verdict/1","evidence":[".context/reviews/evidence/T-1426/AC1-judge-t-1426-r5-claude-code-5aa4a05d20b8.md"],"guidance":"All 7 legacy verbs warn exactly once and TERMLINK_NO_DEPRECATION_WARN=1 suppresses (checked on paths that reach the helper). Two replacement hints are wrong: (1) file send says 'termlink channel post --file' but channel post has no --file flag (and the T-1166 migration guide says to keep using file send/receive); (2) targeted event broadcast says 'event emit_to' but the verb is 'emit-to'. Fix file.rs:185 and events.rs:280. Also fix the AC steps: 'remote push x --message x' and 'event broadcast topic-x payload' fail clap parsing before the helper runs, so the step-4 suppression check prints 0 for that reason, not because of suppression. Use 'remote push 127.0.0.1:1 x --message x --secret <64hex>' and 'event broadcast topic-x --payload notjson'.","judge":"reviewer-judge-t-1426-r5-claude-code-5aa4a05d20b8:claude-code","judged":"T-1426#AC1","meaning":"proceed, and record the guidance against the thing judged","state":"amber","ts":"2026-10-26T21:55:45Z"},"outcome":"amber","reviewer":"reviewer-judge-t-1426-r5-claude-code-5aa4a05d20b8:claude-code","revision":"e42276945e4009f580dcc935e75ff21470d5888c","run_id":"run-t-1426-79e392a3cb","rung":"rung-5-panel:claude-code","task":"T-1426","ts":"2026-10-26T21:55:45Z","verdict":"amber","worker":"reviewer-judge-t-1426-r5-claude-code-5aa4a05d20b8"}
